# Knowledge Completion Agent

When this rule is relevant, read [`skills/knowledge-completion/SKILL.md`](../../skills/knowledge-completion/SKILL.md) before acting.

Prefer the bundled `submit-run.mjs` helper so the result receives a durable `runId` and opens at `/runs/:runId`. Use the repository CLI only as a non-visual fallback. Keep note evidence, model proposals, and external evidence separate. Never mark an unsupported adjacent concept as covered or understood. Report the provider, graph counts, projection counts, stop reason, warnings, boundary concepts, and dashboard URL.
